### Page 1 of 2

```text
12187-0018/LEGAL28029070.1

U.S. Bank / City of Cheyenne, WY

Bill of Sale
1
BILL OF SALE
For good and valuable consideration, the receipt and sufficiency of which are hereby
acknowledged, the undersigned, individually and collectively, hereby assigns, sells, quit claims
and transfers to U.S. Bank National Association, a national banking association (the "Buyer"), all
of their right, title and interest, if any, in and to all tangible personal property  (collectively, the
"Personal Property") owned by the undersigned and located at and used solely in connection with
the premises more particularly described on Exhibit A, attached hereto and incorporated by this
reference.  The Personal Property is free and clear of all liens and encumbrances.
TO HAVE AND TO HOLD the Personal Property unto Buyer and Buyer's successors and
assigns forever.
This conveyance is made without warranties or representations whether express or
implied, of any kind or nature other than the warranty of title contained herein.  Such Personal
Property is being conveyed in an "as is” "where is" condition.
IN WITNESS WHEREOF, the undersigned has executed this Bill of Sale as of this
_______ day of _____________________, 2013.

CITY OF CHEYENNE, WYOMING

By:

Name:

Title:

APPROVED AS TO FORM:

By:

Name:

Title:
```

